<title>USA: TWA offers e-mail notification of specials.</title>
<headline>TWA offers e-mail notification of specials.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trans World Airlines Inc said Monday it has launched a personalized electronic mail system to notify customers of special fares.</p>
<p>The system, Trans World Specials, allows consumers to sign up at the company's web site to receive information on special fares, the airline said.</p>
<p>TWA said it began marketing special low fares over the Internet in October.</p>
<p>TWA shares closed unchanged at 6-5/8 Monday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787)).</p>
